          "ruleId": "CVE-2024-23342",
          "ruleIndex": 4,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "CVE-2024-23342 in ecdsa 0.19.2 (Minerva timing attack vulnerability)\n\nThe `ecdsa` package version **0.19.2** is vulnerable to **CVE-2024-23342**, a cryptographic timing attack known as the **Minerva attack**. This pure Python implementation of Elliptic Curve Cryptography exhibits timing side-channels during ECDSA signature operations, potentially allowing attackers to recover private keys through careful timing analysis of signature generation. The advisory notes that **no patched version exists** as of the CVE publication."
          },
          "locations": [
